stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    accTitle: Proposed membership state machine
    accDescr: Admission establishes Alive. Suspicion and matching failure evidence advance state. Only a newer owner announcement refutes suspicion or death; leave closes the epoch and requires a newer epoch to rejoin.
    [*] --> Candidate: endpoint or relayed claim
    Candidate --> Alive: normal admission + fresh owner Alive
    Alive --> Suspect: failed probe attempt or valid suspicion
    Suspect --> Dead: matching deadline or valid failure
    Suspect --> Alive: owner Alive with newer incarnation
    Dead --> Alive: owner Alive with newer incarnation
    Alive --> Left: valid owner leave
    Suspect --> Left: valid owner leave
    Dead --> Left: valid owner leave
    Left --> Alive: newer durable epoch + admission
    note right of Candidate
        Connection and membership are separate.
        Relayed identity alone grants no admission.
    end note
    note right of Dead
        Same pair: Dead > Suspect > Alive.
        ACK alone does not refute a suspicion.
        Persist rejection floor before terminal publication.
    end note
    note right of Left
        Left closes the entire epoch.
        Same-epoch updates cannot reopen it.
    end note
